BEGIN_PGML
Give three points which lie on the graph of [`T\text{,}`] separated by commas.

[_]{$evaluator}{10}

Which of the following statements is true about the graph of [`T(s)\text{?}`]

[_]{$radio}{5}

END_PGML

Section::End();

