BEGIN_PGML
Recall the average rate of change of a function [`f(x)`] on an interval [`[a,b]`] is

[```AV_{[a,b]}=\frac{f(b)-f(a)}{b-a}\text{.}```]

Determine the average rate of [`T`] on the interval [`[60,65]\text{,}`] [`AV_{[60, 65]}\text{.}`]

[_]{$answer3}{10} [_]{$popup2}{5}

END_PGML

Section::End();

############################################################
# Section
############################################################
Section::Begin("");

BEGIN_PGML
The sign of [`AV_{[60, 65]}`] is [_]{$popup}{5}

This sign makes sense because

[_]{$radio3}{5}

END_PGML

Section::End();

############################################################
# Section
############################################################
Section::Begin("");

BEGIN_PGML
Which of the following explains the meaning of the value of [`AV_{[60, 65]}\text{?}`]

[_]{$radio4}{5}

END_PGML

Section::End();

Scaffold::End();

