>> [@DataTable( [ [PGML('[`f(x)=`]'), PGML('[`\sin(x)`]'), PGML('[`f^{(5)}(x)=`]'), PGML('[_]{$c}{10}'), ], [PGML(q"[`f'(x)=`]"), PGML('[`\cos(x)`]'), PGML('[`f^{(6)}(x)=`]'), PGML('[_]{-$s}{10}'), ], [PGML(q"[`f''(x)=`]"), PGML('[`-\sin(x)`]'), PGML('[`f^{(7)}(x)=`]'), PGML('[_]{-$c}{10}'), ], [PGML(q"[`f'''(x)=`]"), PGML('[`-\cos(x)`]'), PGML('[`f^{(8)}(x)=`]'), PGML('[_]{$s}{10}'), ], [PGML('[`f^{(4)}(x)=`]'), PGML('[_]{$s}{10}'), PGML('[`f^{(9)}(x)=`]'), PGML('[_]{$c}{10}'), ], ], align => 'rl|rl', valign => 'middle',);@]* <<
What is the value of [`f^{(n)}(0)`] (the nth derivative of [`f`] evaluated at [`x = 0`]) when [`n`] is even? [_]{$popup2}{5}
What is the value of [`f^{(n)}(0)`] (the nth derivative of [`f`] evaluated at [`x = 0`]) when [`n`] is odd? [_]{$popup1}{5}
